{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"My lady, kord, ilmater, and lythander.\" He nods solemnly. \"I took these bracers to hold faith that my lady will return to me, there was also a mask dedicated to melora but her grave was not there. Storm took the mask and wynne carries their deity ilmaters cord. We brought this and lythanders shield, castor took the shield until we can find something more suitable.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T16:34:17.494000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737709528161714307","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
