{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"I have no parents, no family. When I was nothing more then a kitten I was left on the doorsteps of the Field Scholars Guild. I grew up there, working, learning to fight, no childhood. When I was only 13 years old I was being sent away on missions. My Tabaxi traits make me a very strong scout even at that young age. Until they were not good enough. I was exhausted, I had spent 5 days in the woods alone, and afraid. I fell asleep on my post, the enemies I was meant to scout slipped by me, and murdered my friends. I carry the weight of that every day.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T17:24:44.665000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737722225037148180","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"You were 13 and started going on mission?? I was 13 and my parents were killed and i was forced into the thieves guild!\" Castor exclaims with slight thrill as he has found someone who knows what hes been through","created_at":"2020-07-28T17:26:05.786000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737722565283545198","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"(Tragic backstory gang)","created_at":"2020-07-28T17:26:50.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737722750935761007","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"You see Castor. I have made my way through most of that pain, and onto the other side. I want you to be able to do the same. You have light within you a bright shiny light of laughter. I don't want to see it extinguished. Care for yourself Sir and when you feel that your past is coming up out of the dark to get you. Know that I am in a tree somewhere and I am watching your back.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T17:29:09.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737723334581813341","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"I see your point... thank you sir cato... I am sorry for how i treated you in london...\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T17:29:49.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737723504685744168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
